#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:5
msgid "The RELIC atmosphere domain (`relic.scientific.atmosphere`) supplies radiative energy partitioning, Monin-Obukhov surface-layer turbulence, vertical and three-dimensional boundary-layer tracer transport, parallel dry-deposition resistance networks, open photostationary and closed constant-volume gas-phase chemistry, and exact-replay stochastic weather generators (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 17, 18, and 27). In addition, `relic.coupling.observation` provides read-only `ScaleCouplingFunctor` observation operators that project surface fluxes and layered mixing ratios onto satellite column retrievals and eddy-covariance tower supports."
msgstr "RELIC 大气圈领域（`relic.scientific.atmosphere`）提供辐射能量分配、Monin-Obukhov 近地层湍流、大气边界层（Atmospheric Boundary Layer, ABL）垂向与三维示踪物输运、并联干沉降阻力网络、开放光稳态与封闭定容气相化学以及精确重放随机天气发生器（《生态学分析方法》，第 17、18 与 27 章）。此外，`relic.coupling.observation` 提供只读 `ScaleCouplingFunctor` 观测算子，将地表通量与分层混合比投影至卫星柱浓度反演与涡度相关通量塔支撑域。"

