#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:43
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.radiation.RadiationFunctor` (`Level 2`) evaluates downward and net shortwave and longwave irradiances [W m$^{-2}$] from potential insolation $S_{\\mathrm{pot}}$, cosine solar zenith angle $\\mu_0 = \\cos\\theta_z$, cloud fraction $f_c \\in [0, 1]$, air and surface temperatures $T_a, T_s$ [K], relative humidity $\\mathrm{RH} \\in [0, 100]$, surface albedo $\\alpha \\in [0, 1]$, and surface emissivity $\\varepsilon_s \\in (0, 1]$ (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 17):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.radiation.RadiationFunctor`（`Level 2`）依据潜在日射 $S_{\\mathrm{pot}}$、太阳天顶角余弦 $\\mu_0 = \\cos\\theta_z$、云量分数 $f_c \\in [0, 1]$、气温与地表温度 $T_a, T_s$ [K]、相对湿度 $\\mathrm{RH} \\in [0, 100]$、地表反照率 $\\alpha \\in [0, 1]$ 以及地表发射率 $\\varepsilon_s \\in (0, 1]$ 计算下行与净短波及长波辐照度 [W m$^{-2}$]（《生态学分析方法》，第 17 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:51
msgid ""
"\n"
"S_\\downarrow = S_{\\mathrm{pot}}\\,\\tau_c(f_c),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"S_{\\mathrm{net}} = (1 - \\alpha)\\,S_\\downarrow,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"S_\\downarrow = S_{\\mathrm{pot}}\\,\\tau_c(f_c),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"S_{\\mathrm{net}} = (1 - \\alpha)\\,S_\\downarrow,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:57
msgid ""
"\n"
"L_\\downarrow = \\varepsilon_a(e_a, T_a, f_c)\\,\\sigma_{\\mathrm{SB}} T_a^4,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"L_\\uparrow = \\varepsilon_s\\,\\sigma_{\\mathrm{SB}} T_s^4 + (1 - \\varepsilon_s)\\,L_\\downarrow,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"L_\\downarrow = \\varepsilon_a(e_a, T_a, f_c)\\,\\sigma_{\\mathrm{SB}} T_a^4,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"L_\\uparrow = \\varepsilon_s\\,\\sigma_{\\mathrm{SB}} T_s^4 + (1 - \\varepsilon_s)\\,L_\\downarrow,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:63
msgid ""
"\n"
"L_{\\mathrm{net}} = L_\\downarrow - L_\\uparrow\n"
"= \\varepsilon_s\\left(L_\\downarrow - \\sigma_{\\mathrm{SB}} T_s^4\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"R_n = S_{\\mathrm{net}} + L_{\\mathrm{net}},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"L_{\\mathrm{net}} = L_\\downarrow - L_\\uparrow\n"
"= \\varepsilon_s\\left(L_\\downarrow - \\sigma_{\\mathrm{SB}} T_s^4\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"R_n = S_{\\mathrm{net}} + L_{\\mathrm{net}},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:70
msgid "where $\\sigma_{\\mathrm{SB}}$ is fetched from `relic.utils.physical_constants` (`get_physical_constant(\"stefan_boltzmann\")`) and clear-sky atmospheric emissivity follows Brutsaert (1975), $\\varepsilon_{a,\\mathrm{clear}} = c_B\\,(e_a / T_a)^{1/7}$, modulated by cloud cover. Photosynthetically active radiation (PAR) and photosynthetic photon flux density ($\\mathrm{PPFD}$, [$\\mu$mol m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$]) are split into direct-beam and diffuse components:"
msgstr "其中 $\\sigma_{\\mathrm{SB}}$ 取自 `relic.utils.physical_constants`（`get_physical_constant(\"stefan_boltzmann\")`），晴空大气发射率遵循 Brutsaert（1975）公式 $\\varepsilon_{a,\\mathrm{clear}} = c_B\\,(e_a / T_a)^{1/7}$ 并经云量调制。光合有效辐射（PAR）与光合光子通量密度（$\\mathrm{PPFD}$，[$\\mu$mol m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$]）被拆分为直射束与漫射分量："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:77
msgid ""
"\n"
"I_{\\mathrm{PAR}} = f_{\\mathrm{PAR}}\\,S_\\downarrow,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{PPFD} = \\kappa_{Q}\\,I_{\\mathrm{PAR}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{diff}} = f_{\\mathrm{diff}}(\\mu_0, f_c)\\,\\mathrm{PPFD},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{dir}} = \\mathrm{PPFD} - \\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{diff}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"I_{\\mathrm{PAR}} = f_{\\mathrm{PAR}}\\,S_\\downarrow,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{PPFD} = \\kappa_{Q}\\,I_{\\mathrm{PAR}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{diff}} = f_{\\mathrm{diff}}(\\mu_0, f_c)\\,\\mathrm{PPFD},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{dir}} = \\mathrm{PPFD} - \\mathrm{PPFD}_{\\mathrm{diff}}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:87
msgid "When `leaf_area_index` ($L_{\\mathrm{AI}} \\ge 0$) is present, canopy interception follows Beer-Lambert extinction with direct and diffuse extinction coefficients $k_b(\\mu_0)$ and $k_d$:"
msgstr "当输入包含叶面积指数 `leaf_area_index`（$L_{\\mathrm{AI}} \\ge 0$）时，冠层截获遵循具有直射与漫射消光系数 $k_b(\\mu_0)$ 和 $k_d$ 的 Beer-Lambert 消光定律："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:91
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\tau_{\\mathrm{dir}} = \\exp\\!\\left(-k_b(\\mu_0)\\,L_{\\mathrm{AI}}\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\tau_{\\mathrm{diff}} = \\exp\\!\\left(-k_d\\,L_{\\mathrm{AI}}\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"f_{\\mathrm{PAR,abs}} = 1 - \\frac{I_{\\mathrm{PAR,dir}}\\tau_{\\mathrm{dir}} + I_{\\mathrm{PAR,diff}}\\tau_{\\mathrm{diff}}}{\\max(I_{\\mathrm{PAR}}, \\varepsilon_I)}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\tau_{\\mathrm{dir}} = \\exp\\!\\left(-k_b(\\mu_0)\\,L_{\\mathrm{AI}}\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\tau_{\\mathrm{diff}} = \\exp\\!\\left(-k_d\\,L_{\\mathrm{AI}}\\right),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"f_{\\mathrm{PAR,abs}} = 1 - \\frac{I_{\\mathrm{PAR,dir}}\\tau_{\\mathrm{dir}} + I_{\\mathrm{PAR,diff}}\\tau_{\\mathrm{diff}}}{\\max(I_{\\mathrm{PAR}}, \\varepsilon_I)}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:99
msgid "Any positivity clamp applied to noisy shortwave or emissivity inputs is recorded explicitly in `diagnostics.radiation.shortwave_clipping_residual` and `diagnostics.radiation.emissivity_clipping_residual`."
msgstr "对含噪短波辐射或发射率输入施加的任何非负截断均显式记录于 `diagnostics.radiation.shortwave_clipping_residual` 与 `diagnostics.radiation.emissivity_clipping_residual`。"

