msgid "Cochain radiation fields and radiative balance validation"
msgstr "上链辐射场与辐射平衡校验"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:105
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.radiation.RadiationField` (`Level 3`) treats gridded irradiance as a discrete scalar field on `grid_coordinates`, supporting bilinear or trilinear query projection onto `source_coordinates` and discrete gradient evaluation $g_h = d_h I_h$ while reporting domain-clamp residuals in `diagnostics.radiation_field.clipping_residual`."
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.radiation.RadiationField`（`Level 3`）将网格化辐照度表示为 `grid_coordinates` 上的离散标量场，支持向 `source_coordinates` 的双线性或三线性查询投影以及离散梯度求值 $g_h = d_h I_h$，并在 `diagnostics.radiation_field.clipping_residual` 中报告定义域截断残差。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:111
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.radiation_energy_conservation.RadiationEnergyConservationValidator` (`Level 1`) is a pure diagnostic observer ($\\Delta x_h = 0$) verifying the pointwise radiative closure residual"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.radiation_energy_conservation.RadiationEnergyConservationValidator`（`Level 1`）为纯诊断观测器（$\\Delta x_h = 0$），用于逐点校验辐射闭合残差"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:115
msgid ""
"\n"
"r_{\\mathrm{rad}} = R_n - \\left[(1 - \\alpha)S_\\downarrow + L_\\downarrow - L_\\uparrow\\right]\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"r_{\\mathrm{rad}} = R_n - \\left[(1 - \\alpha)S_\\downarrow + L_\\downarrow - L_\\uparrow\\right]\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:119
msgid "against the configured tolerance without overwriting any radiative flux channel."
msgstr "是否满足配置容差，且不覆写任何辐射通量通道。"

