msgstr "近地层湍流与边界层示踪物输运"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:123
msgid "Monin-Obukhov similarity and aerodynamic resistance"
msgstr "Monin-Obukhov 相似理论与空气动力学阻力"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:125
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.turbulence.TurbulenceFunctor` (`Level 3`) closes constant-flux surface-layer momentum and scalar exchange using Monin-Obukhov similarity theory (Monin and Obukhov, 1954; Businger et al., 1971; Dyer, 1974). For reference height $z_r$, displacement height $d_0$, aerodynamic and thermal roughness lengths $z_{0m}, z_{0h}$, von Karman constant $\\kappa$, and virtual potential temperature $\\theta_v$, the Obukhov length $L$ and dimensionless stability parameter $\\zeta = (z_r - d_0)/L$ satisfy"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.turbulence.TurbulenceFunctor`（`Level 3`）采用 Monin-Obukhov 相似理论闭合常通量近地层动量与标量交换（Monin and Obukhov, 1954；Businger et al., 1971；Dyer, 1974）。给定参考高度 $z_r$、零平面位移高度 $d_0$、空气动力学与热力粗糙度长度 $z_{0m}, z_{0h}$、von Karman 常数 $\\kappa$ 以及虚位温 $\\theta_v$，Obukhov 长度 $L$ 与无量纲稳定度参数 $\\zeta = (z_r - d_0)/L$ 满足"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:133
msgid ""
"\n"
"L = -\\frac{\\rho_a c_p \\theta_v u_\\ast^3}{\\kappa g H_v},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"u_\\ast = \\frac{\\kappa U(z_r)}{\\ln\\!\\left(\\frac{z_r - d_0}{z_{0m}}\\right) - \\Psi_m(\\zeta) + \\Psi_m\\!\\left(\\frac{z_{0m}}{L}\\right)},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"L = -\\frac{\\rho_a c_p \\theta_v u_\\ast^3}{\\kappa g H_v},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"u_\\ast = \\frac{\\kappa U(z_r)}{\\ln\\!\\left(\\frac{z_r - d_0}{z_{0m}}\\right) - \\Psi_m(\\zeta) + \\Psi_m\\!\\left(\\frac{z_{0m}}{L}\\right)},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:139
msgid ""
"\n"
"r_a = \\frac{\\ln\\!\\left(\\frac{z_r - d_0}{z_{0h}}\\right) - \\Psi_h(\\zeta) + \\Psi_h\\!\\left(\\frac{z_{0h}}{L}\\right)}{\\kappa u_\\ast},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"K_m(z) = \\frac{\\kappa u_\\ast (z - d_0)}{\\phi_m(\\zeta)},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"K_h(z) = \\frac{\\kappa u_\\ast (z - d_0)}{\\phi_h(\\zeta)},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"r_a = \\frac{\\ln\\!\\left(\\frac{z_r - d_0}{z_{0h}}\\right) - \\Psi_h(\\zeta) + \\Psi_h\\!\\left(\\frac{z_{0h}}{L}\\right)}{\\kappa u_\\ast},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"K_m(z) = \\frac{\\kappa u_\\ast (z - d_0)}{\\phi_m(\\zeta)},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"K_h(z) = \\frac{\\kappa u_\\ast (z - d_0)}{\\phi_h(\\zeta)},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:147
msgid "where $\\phi_m, \\phi_h$ and their integrated stability corrections $\\Psi_m, \\Psi_h$ follow Businger-Dyer unstable ($\\zeta < 0$) and linear stable ($\\zeta \\ge 0$) branches. Sensible and latent heat fluxes $H = \\rho_a c_p (\\theta_s - \\theta_a)/r_a$ and $\\lambda E$ are emitted as instantaneous `REPLACE` boundary fields."
msgstr "其中廓线函数 $\\phi_m, \\phi_h$ 及其积分稳定度订正项 $\\Psi_m, \\Psi_h$ 分别遵循 Businger-Dyer 不稳定分支（$\\zeta < 0$）与线性稳定分支（$\\zeta \\ge 0$）。感热通量 $H = \\rho_a c_p (\\theta_s - \\theta_a)/r_a$ 与潜热通量 $\\lambda E$ 作为瞬时 `REPLACE` 边界场输出。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:152
msgid "Vertical K-profile and 3D advection-diffusion transport"
msgstr "垂向 K-廓线与三维平流-扩散输运"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:154
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.transport.eddy_diffusion_blm.EddyDiffusionBLMFunctor` (`Level 3`) advances 1D vertical boundary-layer tracer concentrations $c(z,t)$ across a boundary layer of height $h_{\\mathrm{BL}}$ with profile diffusivity (Troen and Mahrt, 1986; Holtslag and Boville, 1993):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.transport.eddy_diffusion_blm.EddyDiffusionBLMFunctor`（`Level 3`）在高度为 $h_{\\mathrm{BL}}$ 的边界层内采用廓线扩散系数推进一维垂向示踪物浓度 $c(z,t)$（Troen and Mahrt, 1986；Holtslag and Boville, 1993）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:159
msgid ""
"\n"
"K_z(z) = \\kappa\\,w_s\\,z\\left(1 - \\frac{z}{h_{\\mathrm{BL}}}\\right)^p,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"0 \\le z \\le h_{\\mathrm{BL}},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"K_z(z) = \\kappa\\,w_s\\,z\\left(1 - \\frac{z}{h_{\\mathrm{BL}}}\\right)^p,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"0 \\le z \\le h_{\\mathrm{BL}},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:165
msgid "discretized in conservative finite-volume cochain form"
msgstr "按守恒有限体积上链形式离散为"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:167
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}c_h}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -D_h q_h + G_h u_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"q_h = -\\star_{K_z} d_h c_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\star_{K_z} = \\star_{K_z}^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}c_h}{\\mathrm{d}t} = -D_h q_h + G_h u_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"q_h = -\\star_{K_z} d_h c_h,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\star_{K_z} = \\star_{K_z}^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:175
msgid "where surface emissions and dry-deposition sinks enter only through the boundary port $G_h u_h$."
msgstr "其中地表排放与干沉降汇仅经由边界端口 $G_h u_h$ 注入。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:178
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.transport.AtmosphericAdvectionDiffusionFunctor.AtmosphericAdvectionDiffusionFunctor` (`Level 3`) generalizes tracer transport to three-dimensional structured grids with wind components $(u, v, w)$ and anisotropic eddy diffusivities $\\mathbf{K} = \\operatorname{diag}(K_x, K_y, K_z)$:"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.transport.AtmosphericAdvectionDiffusionFunctor.AtmosphericAdvectionDiffusionFunctor`（`Level 3`）将示踪物输运推广至具有风速分量 $(u, v, w)$ 与各向异性涡动扩散张量 $\\mathbf{K} = \\operatorname{diag}(K_x, K_y, K_z)$ 的三维结构化网格："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:183
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial c}{\\partial t} + \\nabla \\cdot (\\mathbf{v} c - \\mathbf{K}\\nabla c) = s_{\\mathrm{ext}},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial c}{\\partial t} + \\nabla \\cdot (\\mathbf{v} c - \\mathbf{K}\\nabla c) = s_{\\mathrm{ext}},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:187
msgid "using conservative upwind advective face fluxes and centered diffusive face fluxes. Both transport Functors emit integrated per-step concentration increments via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` and verify discrete column or volume mass closure against boundary fluxes."
msgstr "采用守恒迎风平流面通量与中心差分扩散面通量。上述两类输运算子均通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 输出单步积分浓度增量，并对照边界通量校验离散气柱或体积质量闭合。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:192
msgid "Environmental forcing projection and Wesely dry deposition"
msgstr "环境强迫投影与 Wesely 干沉降"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:194
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.environmental_forcing.EnvironmentalForcingFunctor` (`Level 2`) validates physical bounds, unit consistency, and finiteness of prescribed meteorological and trace-gas driver arrays before projecting them into `StateManager` via `REPLACE`."
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.environmental_forcing.EnvironmentalForcingFunctor`（`Level 2`）先校验给定气象与痕量气体驱动数组的物理界、单位一致性与有限性，再通过 `REPLACE` 将其投影至 `StateManager`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:199
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.transport.dry_deposition_aggregator.DryDepositionAggregator` (`Level 3`) computes species-resolved dry-deposition velocities $v_{d,s}$ [m s$^{-1}$] and downward surface removal fluxes $F_{\\mathrm{dep},s} = v_{d,s} c_s(z_r)$ using the Wesely (1989) series-parallel resistance network (aerodynamic resistance $r_a$, quasi-laminar sublayer resistance $r_{b,s} = \\frac{2}{\\kappa u_\\ast}(\\mathrm{Sc}_s / \\mathrm{Pr})^{2/3}$, and bulk canopy/surface resistance $r_{c,s}$ combining stomatal, cuticular, mesophyll, and ground pathways in parallel):"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.transport.dry_deposition_aggregator.DryDepositionAggregator`（`Level 3`）采用 Wesely（1989）串并联阻力网络（空气动力学阻力 $r_a$、准层流副层阻力 $r_{b,s} = \\frac{2}{\\kappa u_\\ast}(\\mathrm{Sc}_s / \\mathrm{Pr})^{2/3}$ 以及并联整合气孔、角质层、叶肉与地面通路的整冠层/地表阻力 $r_{c,s}$）计算分物种干沉降速率 $v_{d,s}$ [m s$^{-1}$] 与向下地表清除通量 $F_{\\mathrm{dep},s} = v_{d,s} c_s(z_r)$："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:207
msgid ""
"\n"
"v_{d,s} = \\frac{1}{r_a + r_{b,s} + r_{c,s}} + v_{\\mathrm{grav},s},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{dep},s} = v_{d,s}\\,c_s(z_r) \\ge 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"v_{d,s} = \\frac{1}{r_a + r_{b,s} + r_{c,s}} + v_{\\mathrm{grav},s},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"F_{\\mathrm{dep},s} = v_{d,s}\\,c_s(z_r) \\ge 0.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:213
msgid "Because $r_a, r_{b,s}, r_{c,s} > 0$, conductance $v_{d,s}$ is strictly positive and defines a passive linear boundary sink ($\\star_{v_d} \\succeq 0$) without directly mutating atmospheric concentration storage; the selected atmospheric transport owner consumes $F_{\\mathrm{dep},s}$ once."
msgstr "由于 $r_a, r_{b,s}, r_{c,s} > 0$，导度 $v_{d,s}$ 严格为正，定义无源线性边界汇（$\\star_{v_d} \\succeq 0$）且不直接修改大气浓度存量；选定的大气输运归属算子单次消费 $F_{\\mathrm{dep},s}$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:218
msgid "Gas-phase chemistry: open tropospheric kinetics and closed Level-5 GENERIC point"
msgstr "气相化学：开放对流层动力学与封闭 Level-5 GENERIC 运行点"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:220
msgid "Open tropospheric photostationary and BVOC-HOx mode (Level 3)"
msgstr "开放对流层光稳态与 BVOC-HOx 模式（Level 3）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:222
#, python-brace-format
msgid "In its default open-atmosphere configuration, `relic.scientific.atmosphere.chemistry.ChemistryFunctor` (`Level 3`) evaluates tropospheric $\\mathrm{NO}$-$\\mathrm{NO}_2$-$\\mathrm{O}_3$ photostationary kinetics coupled to biogenic VOC ($\\mathrm{C_5H_8}$, monoterpene, and sesquiterpene) oxidation by $\\mathrm{OH}$, $\\mathrm{O}_3$, and $\\mathrm{NO}_3$ (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 18; Leighton, 1961; Atkinson et al., 2006; Warneck and Williams, 2012). Key photolysis and thermal channels include:"
msgstr "在默认开放大气配置下，`relic.scientific.atmosphere.chemistry.ChemistryFunctor`（`Level 3`）计算对流层 $\\mathrm{NO}$-$\\mathrm{NO}_2$-$\\mathrm{O}_3$ 光稳态动力学及其与生物源挥发性有机物（$\\mathrm{C_5H_8}$、单萜与倍半萜）受 $\\mathrm{OH}$、$\\mathrm{O}_3$ 和 $\\mathrm{NO}_3$ 氧化过程的耦合（《生态学分析方法》，第 18 章；Leighton, 1961；Atkinson et al., 2006；Warneck and Williams, 2012）。主要光解与热反应通道包括："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:230
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{NO}_2 + h\\nu \\xrightarrow{J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}} \\mathrm{NO} + \\mathrm{O}(^3\\mathrm{P}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{O}(^3\\mathrm{P}) + \\mathrm{O}_2 + \\mathrm{M} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{O}_3 + \\mathrm{M},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{NO} + \\mathrm{O}_3 \\xrightarrow{k_3(T)} \\mathrm{NO}_2 + \\mathrm{O}_2,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{NO}_2 + h\\nu \\xrightarrow{J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}} \\mathrm{NO} + \\mathrm{O}(^3\\mathrm{P}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{O}(^3\\mathrm{P}) + \\mathrm{O}_2 + \\mathrm{M} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{O}_3 + \\mathrm{M},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathrm{NO} + \\mathrm{O}_3 \\xrightarrow{k_3(T)} \\mathrm{NO}_2 + \\mathrm{O}_2,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:238
msgid "with Arrhenius rate coefficient $k_3(T) = A_3 \\exp(-E_3 / (R T))$ and spectral quantum-yield temperature interpolation for $J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}$ and $J_{\\mathrm{O}(^1\\mathrm{D})}$. In photostationary equilibrium without peroxy radical perturbation, the Leighton ratio satisfies"
msgstr "配以阿伦尼乌斯（Arrhenius）速率系数 $k_3(T) = A_3 \\exp(-E_3 / (R T))$ 以及 $J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}$ 和 $J_{\\mathrm{O}(^1\\mathrm{D})}$ 的光谱量子产率温度插值。在无过氧自由基扰动的光稳态平衡下，Leighton 比值满足"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:243
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PSS}} = \\frac{J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}[\\mathrm{NO}_2]}{k_3(T)[\\mathrm{NO}][\\mathrm{O}_3]} = 1,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"[\\mathrm{O}_3]_{\\mathrm{PSS}} = \\frac{J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}[\\mathrm{NO}_2]}{k_3(T)[\\mathrm{NO}]}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PSS}} = \\frac{J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}[\\mathrm{NO}_2]}{k_3(T)[\\mathrm{NO}][\\mathrm{O}_3]} = 1,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"[\\mathrm{O}_3]_{\\mathrm{PSS}} = \\frac{J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}[\\mathrm{NO}_2]}{k_3(T)[\\mathrm{NO}]}.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:249
msgid "Because actinic photon driving ($J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} > 0$), external BVOC sources, and open boundary conditions supply external free energy, the default mode is certified at `Level 3` (stoichiometric reaction-operator factorization $\\dot{\\mathbf{c}} = \\mathbf{N}\\mathbf{r}(\\mathbf{c}, T, J)$ with verified $\\mathrm{NO}_x$ and oxidant accounting, without claiming closed thermodynamic GENERIC degeneracy)."
msgstr "由于光化光子驱动（$J_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} > 0$）、外部 BVOC 源与开放边界条件持续输入外部自由能，默认模式认证为 `Level 3`（化学计量反应算子分解 $\\dot{\\mathbf{c}} = \\mathbf{N}\\mathbf{r}(\\mathbf{c}, T, J)$，具备经校验的 $\\mathrm{NO}_x$ 与氧化剂核算，不声明封闭热力学 GENERIC 退化性）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:255
msgid "Closed constant-volume adiabatic GENERIC runtime point (Level 5)"
msgstr "封闭定容绝热 GENERIC 运行点（Level 5）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:257
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Under the secondary constructor-conditioned certificate `constructor_selection = {physical_boundary: \"closed_constant_volume\"}` ({ref}`ChemistryFunctor closed constant-volume <class-atmosphere-chemistry-chemistry-functor-closed-constant-volume>`, `Level 5`), `ChemistryFunctor` restricts execution to an isolated, rigid, constant-volume ($V$ = `box_volume` [m$^3$]) adiabatic gas cell containing dark thermal titration"
msgstr "在次级构造条件证书 `constructor_selection = {physical_boundary: \"closed_constant_volume\"}`（{ref}`ChemistryFunctor 封闭定容模式 <class-atmosphere-chemistry-chemistry-functor-closed-constant-volume>`，`Level 5`）下，`ChemistryFunctor` 将执行域限定为包含暗态热滴定反应的孤立刚性定容（$V$ = `box_volume` [m$^3$]）绝热气室："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:264
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{NO} + \\mathrm{O}_3 \\xrightarrow{k_3(T)} \\mathrm{NO}_2 + \\mathrm{O}_2\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{NO} + \\mathrm{O}_3 \\xrightarrow{k_3(T)} \\mathrm{NO}_2 + \\mathrm{O}_2\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:268
msgid "with zero actinic flux ($J = 0$) and zero matter or heat ports. Let $\\mathbf{x} = (n_{\\mathrm{NO}}, n_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}, n_{\\mathrm{O}_3}, n_{\\mathrm{O}_2}, U)^{\\mathsf{T}}$ denote the molar inventories $\\mathbf{n}$ [mol] (`box_no_amount`, `box_no2_amount`, `box_o3_amount`, `box_o2_amount`) and total NASA7 internal energy $U$ [J] (`box_internal_energy`), with extended stoichiometric vector $\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\nu}} = (\\boldsymbol{\\nu}^{\\mathsf{T}}, 0)^{\\mathsf{T}} = (-1, +1, -1, +1, 0)^{\\mathsf{T}}$. On the strictly positive thermodynamic interior ($n_i > 0$, $T > 0$, partial pressures $p_i = n_i R T / V$, NASA7 chemical potentials $\\mu_i = h_i(T) - T s_i(T) + R T \\ln(p_i / p_0)$), the energy functional $E(\\mathbf{x}) = U$ and concave entropy $S(\\mathbf{n}, U)$ yield conjugate effort covectors"
msgstr "此时光化通量为零（$J = 0$），且无物质或热量端口交换。记 $\\mathbf{x} = (n_{\\mathrm{NO}}, n_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}, n_{\\mathrm{O}_3}, n_{\\mathrm{O}_2}, U)^{\\mathsf{T}}$ 为摩尔库存向量 $\\mathbf{n}$ [mol]（`box_no_amount`、`box_no2_amount`、`box_o3_amount`、`box_o2_amount`）与 NASA7 总内能 $U$ [J]（`box_internal_energy`），扩展化学计量向量为 $\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\nu}} = (\\boldsymbol{\\nu}^{\\mathsf{T}}, 0)^{\\mathsf{T}} = (-1, +1, -1, +1, 0)^{\\mathsf{T}}$。在严格正热力学内部（$n_i > 0$，$T > 0$，分压 $p_i = n_i R T / V$，NASA7 化学势 $\\mu_i = h_i(T) - T s_i(T) + R T \\ln(p_i / p_0)$）上，能量泛函 $E(\\mathbf{x}) = U$ 与凹熵泛函 $S(\\mathbf{n}, U)$ 给出共轭势余向量："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:280
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{e}_E = \\frac{\\partial E}{\\partial \\mathbf{x}} = (\\mathbf{0}^{\\mathsf{T}}, 1)^{\\mathsf{T}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{e}_S = \\frac{\\partial S}{\\partial \\mathbf{x}} = \\left(-\\frac{\\boldsymbol{\\mu}(\\mathbf{n}, T)}{T}^{\\mathsf{T}},\\; \\frac{1}{T}\\right)^{\\mathsf{T}},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{e}_E = \\frac{\\partial E}{\\partial \\mathbf{x}} = (\\mathbf{0}^{\\mathsf{T}}, 1)^{\\mathsf{T}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{e}_S = \\frac{\\partial S}{\\partial \\mathbf{x}} = \\left(-\\frac{\\boldsymbol{\\mu}(\\mathbf{n}, T)}{T}^{\\mathsf{T}},\\; \\frac{1}{T}\\right)^{\\mathsf{T}},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:286
msgid "with positive reaction affinity $\\mathcal{A} = -\\boldsymbol{\\nu}^{\\mathsf{T}}\\boldsymbol{\\mu} > 0$ and forward molar rate $r > 0$ (Grmela and Ottinger, 1997; Mielke, 2011). Advancement through `relic.computation.operators.iphs.advance_reaction_network` satisfies the canonical GENERIC evolution ($L_h = 0$)"
msgstr "其正向反应亲和势 $\\mathcal{A} = -\\boldsymbol{\\nu}^{\\mathsf{T}}\\boldsymbol{\\mu} > 0$，正向摩尔反应速率 $r > 0$（Grmela and Ottinger, 1997；Mielke, 2011）。经由 `relic.computation.operators.iphs.advance_reaction_network` 的状态推进满足规范 GENERIC 演化方程（$L_h = 0$）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:291
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{x}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\n"
"= L_h\\mathbf{e}_E + M_h\\mathbf{e}_S\n"
"= \\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\nu}}\\,r,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_h(\\mathbf{x}) = \\frac{r\\,T}{\\mathcal{A}}\\,\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\nu}}\\,\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\nu}}^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{x}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\n"
"= L_h\\mathbf{e}_E + M_h\\mathbf{e}_S\n"
"= \\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\nu}}\\,r,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"M_h(\\mathbf{x}) = \\frac{r\\,T}{\\mathcal{A}}\\,\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\nu}}\\,\\tilde{\\boldsymbol{\\nu}}^{\\mathsf{T}} \\succeq 0,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:299
msgid "with exact energy degeneracy $M_h(\\mathbf{x})\\mathbf{e}_E = \\mathbf{0}$ ($\\Delta U = 0$), exact atomic nitrogen and oxygen conservation ($\\Delta(n_{\\mathrm{NO}} + n_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}) = 0$, $\\Delta(n_{\\mathrm{NO}} + 2n_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} + 3n_{\\mathrm{O}_3} + 2n_{\\mathrm{O}_2}) = 0$), and non-negative entropy production $\\sigma_S = \\mathbf{e}_S^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h(\\mathbf{x})\\mathbf{e}_S = \\mathcal{A} r / T \\ge 0$. This `Level 5` certificate applies exclusively to the closed constant-volume configuration and never transfers to photolytic or open-boundary runs."
msgstr "且满足精确能量退化性 $M_h(\\mathbf{x})\\mathbf{e}_E = \\mathbf{0}$（$\\Delta U = 0$）、精确氮原子与氧原子守恒（$\\Delta(n_{\\mathrm{NO}} + n_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}) = 0$，$\\Delta(n_{\\mathrm{NO}} + 2n_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} + 3n_{\\mathrm{O}_3} + 2n_{\\mathrm{O}_2}) = 0$）以及非负熵产生率 $\\sigma_S = \\mathbf{e}_S^{\\mathsf{T}} M_h(\\mathbf{x})\\mathbf{e}_S = \\mathcal{A} r / T \\ge 0$。该 `Level 5` 证书专属于封闭定容配置，绝不外推至含光解或开放边界的运行工况。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:308
msgid "Stochastic atmospheric forcing and replay contracts"
msgstr "随机大气强迫与重放契约"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:310
msgid "Both stochastic weather Functors inherit `relic.core.functor.stochastic_substream.FunctorSubstreamMixin` (`[I]`), binding an isolated PyTorch `Generator` substream whose byte state is persisted across checkpoint and restart so trajectories replay bit-identically (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 27). Step durations are converted to days via $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}} = \\Delta t / 86400$."
msgstr "两类随机天气算子均继承 `relic.core.functor.stochastic_substream.FunctorSubstreamMixin`（`[I]`），绑定独立隔离的 PyTorch `Generator` 随机数子流，并在检查点保存与重启间持久化其字节状态，确保轨迹逐位精确重放（《生态学分析方法》，第 27 章）。步长按 $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}} = \\Delta t / 86400$ 换算为天。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:317
msgid "Ornstein-Uhlenbeck air-temperature anomaly"
msgstr "Ornstein-Uhlenbeck 气温距平"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:319
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.stochastic_temperature.OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor` (`Level 2`) models mean-reverting synoptic temperature anomalies $X_t$ [K] via the Ito stochastic differential equation"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.stochastic_temperature.OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor`（`Level 2`）通过伊藤（Ito）SDE 模拟均值回归的天气尺度温度距平 $X_t$ [K]："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:323
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{d}X_t = -\\alpha X_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t_{\\mathrm{days}} + \\sigma\\,\\mathrm{d}W_{t_{\\mathrm{days}}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\alpha > 0,\\quad \\sigma \\ge 0,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathrm{d}X_t = -\\alpha X_t\\,\\mathrm{d}t_{\\mathrm{days}} + \\sigma\\,\\mathrm{d}W_{t_{\\mathrm{days}}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\alpha > 0,\\quad \\sigma \\ge 0,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:329
msgid "discretized over $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}$ by `relic.stochastic.sde_solver.EulerMaruyamaSolver`:"
msgstr "由 `relic.stochastic.sde_solver.EulerMaruyamaSolver` 在 $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}$ 上离散为："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:332
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta X_n = -\\alpha X_n\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}} + \\sigma\\sqrt{\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}}\\,\\xi_n,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\xi_n \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, 1).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Delta X_n = -\\alpha X_n\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}} + \\sigma\\sqrt{\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}}\\,\\xi_n,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\xi_n \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, 1).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:338
msgid "`stochastic_air_temperature_anomaly` is updated via `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)`, while step drift, diffusion scale, and Wiener increments are emitted as `REPLACE` diagnostics."
msgstr "`stochastic_air_temperature_anomaly` 通过 `UpdateItem(ACCUMULATE, per_timestep=True)` 更新，单步漂移项、扩散尺度与维纳（Wiener）增量作为 `REPLACE` 诊断量输出。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:342
msgid "Marked Poisson storm rainfall generator"
msgstr "标记泊松暴雨降雨发生器"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:344
msgid "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.stochastic_rainfall.MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor` (`Level 2`) generates intermittent storm arrivals of constant hazard rate $\\lambda > 0$ [day$^{-1}$] and independent exponential storm depths of mean $\\alpha > 0$ [mm] (Rodriguez-Iturbe et al., 1999). Exact inter-arrival sampling over $\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}$ is performed by `relic.stochastic.gillespie.GillespieSSA` subject to a fail-closed per-cell arrival cap $K_{\\max} = \\lceil \\mu + 12\\sqrt{\\mu} + 64 \\rceil$ ($\\mu = \\lambda \\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}$). For $k = \\Delta N_n$ arrivals with unit exponential variates $E_i \\sim \\operatorname{Exp}(1)$ (reparameterized as $z_i = \\alpha E_i$ so pathwise $\\partial \\Delta H_n / \\partial \\alpha$ preserves PyTorch autograd), the cumulative event count and rainfall depth increments are"
msgstr "`relic.scientific.atmosphere.stochastic_rainfall.MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor`（`Level 2`）生成具有常危险率 $\\lambda > 0$ [day$^{-1}$] 的间歇性暴雨到达事件及均值为 $\\alpha > 0$ [mm] 的独立指数分布单场雨深（Rodriguez-Iturbe et al., 1999）。$\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}$ 内的精确到达间隔抽样由 `relic.stochastic.gillespie.GillespieSSA` 执行，并受单网格封闭失败到达上限 $K_{\\max} = \\lceil \\mu + 12\\sqrt{\\mu} + 64 \\rceil$（$\\mu = \\lambda \\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}}$）约束。对于 $k = \\Delta N_n$ 次到达事件及单位指数随机变量 $E_i \\sim \\operatorname{Exp}(1)$（重参数化为 $z_i = \\alpha E_i$，使逐路径导数 $\\partial \\Delta H_n / \\partial \\alpha$ 保持 PyTorch 自动微分），累积事件计数增量与降雨深度增量为"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:356
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta N_n = k,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta H_n = \\alpha \\sum_{i=1}^{k} E_i,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Delta N_n = k,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\Delta H_n = \\alpha \\sum_{i=1}^{k} E_i,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:362
msgid "with predictable Doob-Meyer compensators"
msgstr "配以可料 Doob-Meyer 补偿过程"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:364
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\widetilde{A}_{N,n} = \\lambda\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widetilde{A}_{H,n} = \\lambda\\,\\alpha\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\widetilde{A}_{N,n} = \\lambda\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\widetilde{A}_{H,n} = \\lambda\\,\\alpha\\,\\Delta t_{\\mathrm{days}},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:370
msgid "emitted in `diagnostics.stochastic_rainfall.compensator_count` and `diagnostics.stochastic_rainfall.compensator_depth` so martingale innovation residuals can be audited directly."
msgstr "输出至 `diagnostics.stochastic_rainfall.compensator_count` 与 `diagnostics.stochastic_rainfall.compensator_depth`，供直接审计鞅新息残差。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:374
msgid "Atmospheric observation operators"
msgstr "大气观测算子"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:376
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Read-only atmospheric observation Functors live in `relic.coupling.observation` outside the 90 certified `relic.scientific.*` process classes. All five inherit `ScaleCouplingFunctor` at `ExecutionPhase.POSTPROCESSING` and emit `VariableKind.DIAGNOSTIC` outputs with `StateWriteMode.DERIVED` ($\\Delta \\mathbf{S} = 0$):"
msgstr "只读大气观测算子位于 90 个已认证 `relic.scientific.*` 过程类之外的 `relic.coupling.observation` 模块中。全部五个算子均继承 `ScaleCouplingFunctor`，在 `ExecutionPhase.POSTPROCESSING` 阶段运行，并以 `StateWriteMode.DERIVED` 输出 `VariableKind.DIAGNOSTIC` 变量（$\\Delta \\mathbf{S} = 0$）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:381
msgid "**Steady-state HCHO column yield (`HchoSteadyStateColumnOperator`)**: `relic.coupling.observation.hcho_steady_state_column.HchoSteadyStateColumnOperator` maps surface isoprene molar emission $E$ [mol m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] (with stoichiometric carbon factor $n_C = 5$) and tropospheric $\\mathrm{NO}_2$ vertical column $\\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}$ [molecule cm$^{-2}$] to steady-state formaldehyde vertical column density $\\Omega_{\\mathrm{HCHO}}$ (Palmer et al., 2003; Marais et al., 2012):"
msgstr "**稳态甲醛（Formaldehyde, HCHO）柱产率算子（`HchoSteadyStateColumnOperator`）**：`relic.coupling.observation.hcho_steady_state_column.HchoSteadyStateColumnOperator` 将地表异戊二烯摩尔排放通量 $E$ [mol m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$]（化学计量碳数因子 $n_C = 5$）与对流层 $\\mathrm{NO}_2$ 垂直柱浓度 $\\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}$ [molecule cm$^{-2}$] 映射为稳态甲醛垂直柱浓度 $\\Omega_{\\mathrm{HCHO}}$（Palmer et al., 2003；Marais et al., 2012）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:389
msgid "\\Omega_{\\mathrm{HCHO}} = S\\!\\left(\\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}\\right) n_C E_{\\mathrm{molec}} + B, \\qquad S\\!\\left(\\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}\\right) = \\begin{cases} m\\,\\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} + c, & \\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} \\le \\Omega_t,\\\\ S_{\\mathrm{high}}, & \\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} > \\Omega_t, \\end{cases}"
msgstr "\\Omega_{\\mathrm{HCHO}} = S\\!\\left(\\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}\\right) n_C E_{\\mathrm{molec}} + B, \\qquad S\\!\\left(\\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2}\\right) = \\begin{cases} m\\,\\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} + c, & \\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} \\le \\Omega_t,\\\\ S_{\\mathrm{high}}, & \\Omega_{\\mathrm{NO}_2} > \\Omega_t, \\end{cases}"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:391
msgid "where $E_{\\mathrm{molec}}$ converts mol m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$ to molecule cm$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$ via `avogadro`, $\\Omega_t = 1.0 \\times 10^{15}$ molecule cm$^{-2}$, and $B$ is background column density. Inputs below the empirical calibration bound $\\Omega_{\\mathrm{low}} = 2.0 \\times 10^{14}$ molecule cm$^{-2}$ are evaluated unclipped along the linear branch while flagging `no2_below_calibrated_range = True`."
msgstr "其中 $E_{\\mathrm{molec}}$ 通过阿伏伽德罗常数 `avogadro` 将 mol m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$ 换算为 molecule cm$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$，$\\Omega_t = 1.0 \\times 10^{15}$ molecule cm$^{-2}$，$B$ 为背景柱浓度。低于经验标定下限 $\\Omega_{\\mathrm{low}} = 2.0 \\times 10^{14}$ molecule cm$^{-2}$ 的输入沿线性分支无截断求值，并置标志位 `no2_below_calibrated_range = True`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:397
msgid "**Satellite averaging-kernel column projection (`SatelliteColumnKernelOperator`)**: `relic.coupling.observation.satellite_column_kernel.SatelliteColumnKernelOperator` constructs hybrid-sigma pressure centers $p_k = a_k + b_k p_s$ and arithmetic or logarithmic interior layer edges ($p_{e,k} = \\frac{1}{2}(p_{k-1}+p_k)$ or $\\sqrt{p_{k-1}p_k}$), computes hydrostatic dry-air and tracer partial columns"
msgstr "**卫星平均核柱投影算子（`SatelliteColumnKernelOperator`）**：`relic.coupling.observation.satellite_column_kernel.SatelliteColumnKernelOperator` 构建混合 sigma-气压层中心 $p_k = a_k + b_k p_s$ 与算术或对数内层界面气压（$p_{e,k} = \\frac{1}{2}(p_{k-1}+p_k)$ 或 $\\sqrt{p_{k-1}p_k}$），计算静力平衡干空气与示踪物分层柱浓度"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:403
msgid "n_k = \\frac{p_{e,k} - p_{e,k+1}}{g\\,M_{\\mathrm{air}}}, \\qquad x_{\\mathrm{pc},k} = \\chi_k\\,n_k,"
msgstr "n_k = \\frac{p_{e,k} - p_{e,k+1}}{g\\,M_{\\mathrm{air}}}, \\qquad x_{\\mathrm{pc},k} = \\chi_k\\,n_k,"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:405
msgid "conservatively remaps model partial columns onto retrieval pressure layers via 1D pressure-interval overlap (`remap_partial_columns`, recording any out-of-range mass in `unmapped_column`), and applies the retrieval averaging kernel $A_l$ across the target vertical domain $T$ (Rodgers, 2000; Eskes and Boersma, 2003):"
msgstr "通过一维气压区间重叠将模式分层柱浓度执行守恒重映射至反演气压层（`remap_partial_columns`，任何超界质量均记录于 `unmapped_column`），并在目标垂向域 $T$ 上施加反演平均核 $A_l$（Rodgers, 2000；Eskes and Boersma, 2003）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:411
msgid "N_{v,\\mathrm{model}} = \\sum_{l \\in T} A_l\\,x_{\\mathrm{pc},l}^{\\mathrm{retr}}."
msgstr "N_{v,\\mathrm{model}} = \\sum_{l \\in T} A_l\\,x_{\\mathrm{pc},l}^{\\mathrm{retr}}."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/atmosphere.md:413
msgid "**Tower footprint, profile, and post-observation quality operators**: `relic.coupling.observation.tower_flux.TowerFluxSupportOperator` projects gridded surface fluxes onto normalized eddy-covariance footprint weights; `relic.coupling.observation.tower_concentration.TowerConcentrationProfileOperator` interpolates vertical mixing-ratio profiles to tower intake heights; and `relic.coupling.observation.quality.PostObservationQualityOperator` evaluates retrieval validity masks and support-coverage flags without altering model prognostic state."
msgstr "**通量塔足迹、廓线与后验观测质量算子**：`relic.coupling.observation.tower_flux.TowerFluxSupportOperator` 将网格化地表通量投影至归一化涡度相关足迹权重；`relic.coupling.observation.tower_concentration.TowerConcentrationProfileOperator` 将垂向混合比廓线插值至通量塔采样口高度；`relic.coupling.observation.quality.PostObservationQualityOperator` 在不改动模式预报状态的前提下评估反演有效性掩膜与支撑域覆盖标志。"

